Supplier: ellipse "Supplier" fit
arrow "materials" "" fit

Procurement: box "Procurement" fit
arrow
Production: box "Production" same
arrow
Warehouse: box "Warehouse" same

arrow "products" "" fit
Distributor: ellipse "Distributor" fit
arrow "delivery" "" fit
Consumer: ellipse "Consumer" fit

Finance: box "Finance" at (1/2<Procurement.w,Warehouse.e>, 1 below 1/2<Procurement,Warehouse>) wid (Warehouse.e.x-Procurement.w.x)
arrow <-> from (Procurement.x, Finance.n.y) to Procurement chop
arrow <-> from (Production.x, Finance.n.y) to Production chop
arrow <-> from (Warehouse.x, Finance.n.y) to Warehouse chop

Company: box ht (Procurement.n.y-Finance.s.y)+0.6 wid (Warehouse.e.x-Procurement.w.x)+0.6 \
    at (1/2<Procurement.w,Warehouse.e>, 1/2<Procurement,Finance>) fill 0xf5f5f5 behind Supplier
"Company" bold at 0.17 below 1/2<Company.nw,Company.ne>
